      <bpmn:userTask id="W2619_Task5" name="Sustainability Coordinator compiles annual waste reduction metrics: total waste…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability Coordinator compiles annual waste reduction metrics: total waste generated, diversion rate, recycling revenue, hazardous waste, carbon emissions avoided, waste intensity per sqm
Responsible (R): Sustainability Coordinator
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
