        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO and COO review waste metrics vs. targets; validates data; Coordinator prepares external ESG disclosure per GRI Standards (Waste 306)
Responsible (R): CFO / COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2619_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2619_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
