Responsible (R): Sustainability Coordinator
Accountable (A): COO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2619_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2619_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
